---
title: "Herdr /restart r3: seed behind the in-flight unit, exact close, the owner launches, clear wins"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Result
    lg1: Restart
    lg2: Breaks NoResumeAfterClear
    lg3: Path to the ClearForgets or NoResumeAfterClear bug
    lg4: Repeats forever, so ClearForgets breaks
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  class lg4 repeats
  s0: Old session and a queued input
  s1: Seed committed#59; gate holds it
  s2: Restart holds the transition and fence
  s3: Exact close confirmed#59; retire and settle
  s4: Old execution retired#59; exclusion still held
  s5: Exclusion released#59; reply pending
  s6: Owner turn began a launch
  s7: Owner turn installed Pending
  s8: Clear began: epoch bumped#59; a turn is launching
  s9: Clear discarded the queue#59; a turn is launching
  s10: Owner turn installed Pending (after a clear)
  s11: Exclusion released#59; superseded reply pending
  s12: A launch resumed the conversation a clear ended
  s13: Clear ended unconfirmed#59; selector still kept
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Commit the seed original (acceptance)
  s1 --> s2: Terminate takes transition and fence
  s2 --> s3: Close only the captured pane
  s3 --> s4: Retire CAS and settle the old turn
  s3 --> s3: Accept an input into the owner queue
  s4 --> s5: Disconnect keeping selector, release, wake
  s5 --> s6: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s6 --> s7: Install Pending over the vacant row
  s7 --> s8: User clear begins: bump the clear epoch
  s8 --> s9: Clear discards the queue and the launching input
  s9 --> s10: Clear's teardown acts on the row
  s8 --> s8: Reply to the command
  s10 --> s11: Clear epoch moved: retire the unsent Pending
  s11 --> s11: Accept an input into the owner queue
  s11 --> s12: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s10 --> s13: Clear epoch moved: retire the unsent Pending
